guarantee: AC-2: a redirect to another origin is refused (compared to the chain's first URL)
file: crates/voicen-core/src/engine/http.rs
added_by: test-writer
equivalent: every URL in previous() was reached by a followed hop, and a hop is followed only when its target has the origin of the hop before it, so by induction last() and first() always share one origin; no input tells them apart
--- old
            .previous()
            .first()
--- new
            .previous()
            .last()
--- end
